{"id":"vol9-06","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-06/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":382.01,"segments":[{"start":2.83,"end":6.75,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["Now",2.83,3.23],["listen",3.23,3.59],["carefully",3.59,4.01],["and",4.01,4.37],["answer",4.37,4.75],["questions",4.75,5.13],["21",5.13,5.91],["to",5.91,6.17],["24.",6.17,6.75]]},{"start":10.4,"end":12.98,"text":"Hi Izzy, can we talk about our presentation?","words":[["Hi",10.4,10.82],["Izzy,",10.82,11.2],["can",11.62,11.78],["we",11.78,11.94],["talk",11.94,12.14],["about",12.14,12.38],["our",12.38,12.58],["presentation?",12.58,12.98]]},{"start":13.68,"end":14.06,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",13.68,14.06]]},{"start":14.44,"end":20.78,"text":"So our topic's the bicycle, its history and its effect on society in the western world.","words":[["So",14.44,14.84],["our",14.84,15.22],["topic's",15.22,15.74],["the",15.74,15.86],["bicycle,",15.86,16.3],["its",16.92,17.08],["history",17.08,17.54],["and",17.54,17.98],["its",17.98,18.32],["effect",18.32,18.74],["on",18.74,19.02],["society",19.02,19.68],["in",19.68,19.88],["the",19.88,19.98],["western",19.98,20.24],["world.",20.24,20.78]]},{"start":21.26,"end":24.52,"text":"We should start with its invention in the 1800s.","words":[["We",21.26,21.52],["should",21.52,21.68],["start",21.68,22.02],["with",22.02,22.4],["its",22.4,22.78],["invention",22.78,23.28],["in",23.28,23.54],["the",23.54,23.64],["1800s.",23.64,24.52]]},{"start":24.58,"end":27.34,"text":"The first bike wasn't very successful was it?","words":[["The",24.58,24.76],["first",24.76,25.1],["bike",25.1,25.54],["wasn't",25.54,25.96],["very",25.96,26.2],["successful",26.2,26.78],["was",26.78,27.1],["it?",27.1,27.34]]},{"start":28.22,"end":32.1,"text":"I think the model they called the safety bicycle is more significant.","words":[["I",28.22,28.44],["think",28.44,28.68],["the",28.68,28.84],["model",28.84,29.06],["they",29.06,29.32],["called",29.32,29.64],["the",29.64,29.86],["safety",29.86,30.3],["bicycle",30.3,30.94],["is",30.94,31.4],["more",31.4,31.64],["significant.",31.64,32.1]]},{"start":32.1,"end":38.08,"text":"Yes. Was that name because it was safe for cyclists of all ages, including young kids?","words":[["Yes.",32.1,33.04],["Was",33.52,33.76],["that",33.76,33.96],["name",33.96,34.3],["because",34.3,34.6],["it",34.6,34.78],["was",34.78,34.88],["safe",34.88,35.28],["for",35.28,35.54],["cyclists",35.54,36.16],["of",36.16,36.34],["all",36.34,36.52],["ages,",36.52,36.9],["including",37.06,37.44],["young",37.44,37.72],["kids?",37.72,38.08]]},{"start":38.68,"end":45.24,"text":"I think it was more to do with the comparison to previous versions, which got their speed from one large wheel.","words":[["I",38.68,38.84],["think",38.84,39.08],["it",39.08,39.28],["was",39.28,39.42],["more",39.42,39.68],["to",39.68,39.84],["do",39.84,39.96],["with",39.96,40.14],["the",40.14,40.24],["comparison",40.24,40.86],["to",40.86,41.22],["previous",41.22,41.54],["versions,",41.54,42.3],["which",42.88,43.12],["got",43.12,43.32],["their",43.32,43.52],["speed",43.52,43.9],["from",43.9,44.24],["one",44.24,44.5],["large",44.5,44.9],["wheel.",44.9,45.24]]},{"start":46.0,"end":50.58,"text":"This bike had equally sized wheels and its speed came from gears.","words":[["This",46.0,46.26],["bike",46.26,46.62],["had",46.62,46.94],["equally",46.94,47.46],["sized",47.46,47.86],["wheels",47.86,48.34],["and",48.34,49.04],["its",49.04,49.22],["speed",49.22,49.62],["came",49.62,49.96],["from",49.96,50.18],["gears.",50.18,50.58]]},{"start":51.4,"end":57.24,"text":"It was an important development as it was the first model that actually looked like a bike you'd see today.","words":[["It",51.4,51.58],["was",51.58,51.7],["an",51.7,51.82],["important",51.82,52.28],["development",52.28,52.9],["as",52.9,53.58],["it",53.58,53.68],["was",53.68,53.8],["the",53.8,53.98],["first",53.98,54.26],["model",54.26,54.64],["that",54.64,54.92],["actually",54.92,55.46],["looked",55.46,55.82],["like",55.82,56.1],["a",56.1,56.24],["bike",56.24,56.42],["you'd",56.42,56.72],["see",56.72,56.88],["today.",56.88,57.24]]},{"start":57.24,"end":63.22,"text":"Right, and the development of that bicycle at the end of the 19th century had an enormous","words":[["Right,",57.24,58.18],["and",58.62,59.0],["the",59.0,59.1],["development",59.1,59.44],["of",59.44,59.74],["that",59.74,59.94],["bicycle",59.94,60.4],["at",60.4,60.62],["the",60.62,60.74],["end",60.74,60.92],["of",60.92,61.04],["the",61.04,61.12],["19th",61.12,62.18],["century",62.18,62.18],["had",62.18,62.54],["an",62.54,62.7],["enormous",62.7,63.22]]},{"start":63.22,"end":64.92,"text":"impact on the working classes.","words":[["impact",63.22,63.8],["on",63.8,64.08],["the",64.08,64.18],["working",64.18,64.42],["classes.",64.42,64.92]]},{"start":65.54,"end":69.4,"text":"You mean how it gave them freedom to move around and look for jobs?","words":[["You",65.54,65.76],["mean",65.76,66.06],["how",66.06,66.36],["it",66.36,66.5],["gave",66.5,66.7],["them",66.7,66.94],["freedom",66.94,67.28],["to",67.28,67.58],["move",67.58,67.74],["around",67.74,68.18],["and",68.18,68.54],["look",68.54,68.8],["for",68.8,69.0],["jobs?",69.0,69.4]]},{"start":70.48,"end":75.38,"text":"I suppose before the bike, they didn't have private transport so were limited in where","words":[["I",70.48,70.62],["suppose",70.62,71.0],["before",71.0,71.46],["the",71.46,71.72],["bike,",71.72,72.04],["they",72.3,72.48],["didn't",72.48,72.84],["have",72.84,73.06],["private",73.06,73.56],["transport",73.56,74.1],["so",74.1,74.54],["were",74.54,74.7],["limited",74.7,75.02],["in",75.02,75.22],["where",75.22,75.38]]},{"start":75.38,"end":76.04,"text":"they could work.","words":[["they",75.38,75.5],["could",75.5,75.68],["work.",75.68,76.04]]},{"start":76.38,"end":79.54,"text":"Right, because it took such a long time to go anywhere.","words":[["Right,",76.38,76.74],["because",77.14,77.38],["it",77.38,77.54],["took",77.54,77.72],["such",77.72,78.02],["a",78.02,78.22],["long",78.22,78.38],["time",78.38,78.72],["to",78.72,78.92],["go",78.92,79.08],["anywhere.",79.08,79.54]]},{"start":80.08,"end":84.48,"text":"But I'd really like to draw attention to how inhabitants of rural areas were able","words":[["But",80.08,80.28],["I'd",80.28,80.54],["really",80.54,80.72],["like",80.72,80.94],["to",80.94,81.12],["draw",81.12,81.3],["attention",81.3,81.68],["to",81.68,81.96],["how",81.96,82.14],["inhabitants",82.14,82.64],["of",82.64,83.0],["rural",83.0,83.38],["areas",83.38,84.0],["were",84.0,84.24],["able",84.24,84.48]]},{"start":84.48,"end":89.38,"text":"to travel outside their communities and that led them to marrying people they never could","words":[["to",84.48,84.64],["travel",84.64,84.96],["outside",84.96,85.4],["their",85.4,85.66],["communities",85.66,86.28],["and",86.28,86.98],["that",86.98,87.18],["led",87.18,87.38],["them",87.38,87.6],["to",87.6,87.76],["marrying",87.76,88.16],["people",88.16,88.68],["they",88.68,88.94],["never",88.94,89.18],["could",89.18,89.38]]},{"start":89.38,"end":94.84,"text":"have met in the past. That changed society and I'd like to discuss it in our presentation.","words":[["have",89.38,89.5],["met",89.5,89.7],["in",89.7,89.9],["the",89.9,89.98],["past.",89.98,90.34],["That",90.92,91.18],["changed",91.18,91.84],["society",91.84,92.5],["and",92.5,93.08],["I'd",93.08,93.26],["like",93.26,93.38],["to",93.38,93.58],["discuss",93.58,93.88],["it",93.88,94.18],["in",94.18,94.3],["our",94.3,94.44],["presentation.",94.44,94.84]]},{"start":95.32,"end":96.02,"text":"Oh, good idea.","words":[["Oh,",95.32,95.48],["good",95.54,95.68],["idea.",95.68,96.02]]},{"start":96.48,"end":101.14,"text":"So what should we stress about changing attitudes to bicycles in the 20th century?","words":[["So",96.48,96.84],["what",96.84,97.08],["should",97.08,97.3],["we",97.3,97.46],["stress",97.46,97.82],["about",97.82,98.1],["changing",98.1,98.56],["attitudes",98.56,99.12],["to",99.12,99.48],["bicycles",99.48,99.84],["in",99.84,100.22],["the",100.22,100.32],["20th",100.32,100.78],["century?",100.78,101.14]]},{"start":101.66,"end":107.72,"text":"Well, the bicycle was an important means of transport through the early 1900s and that","words":[["Well,",101.66,102.06],["the",102.46,102.62],["bicycle",102.62,103.06],["was",103.06,103.4],["an",103.4,103.54],["important",103.54,103.96],["means",103.96,104.26],["of",104.26,104.5],["transport",104.5,105.0],["through",105.0,105.34],["the",105.34,105.5],["early",105.5,105.84],["1900s",105.84,106.98],["and",106.98,107.5],["that",107.5,107.72]]},{"start":107.72,"end":113.98,"text":"continued until the 1950s when cars became available to the general population and","words":[["continued",107.72,108.38],["until",108.38,109.02],["the",109.02,109.2],["1950s",109.2,110.42],["when",110.42,110.74],["cars",110.74,111.1],["became",111.1,111.48],["available",111.48,111.92],["to",111.92,112.24],["the",112.24,112.4],["general",112.4,112.7],["population",112.7,113.48],["and",113.48,113.98]]},{"start":113.98,"end":118.94,"text":"much more popular. That led to people losing interest in bikes for a while.","words":[["much",113.98,114.24],["more",114.24,114.6],["popular.",114.6,115.08],["That",115.98,116.22],["led",116.22,116.46],["to",116.46,116.66],["people",116.66,116.9],["losing",116.9,117.34],["interest",117.34,117.76],["in",117.76,118.08],["bikes",118.08,118.34],["for",118.34,118.56],["a",118.56,118.68],["while.",118.68,118.94]]},{"start":119.4,"end":124.66,"text":"I hadn't realised the impact that people's love of motorised transport had on the bike's reputation.","words":[["I",119.4,119.5],["hadn't",119.5,119.76],["realised",119.76,120.18],["the",120.18,120.5],["impact",120.5,121.08],["that",121.08,121.3],["people's",121.3,121.72],["love",121.72,121.88],["of",121.88,122.04],["motorised",122.04,122.66],["transport",122.66,123.14],["had",123.14,123.46],["on",123.46,123.62],["the",123.62,123.72],["bike's",123.72,124.08],["reputation.",124.08,124.66]]},{"start":125.08,"end":131.64,"text":"Yes, that's a key point we should make. Then the fold-up bike and others came along in the 60s","words":[["Yes,",125.08,125.32],["that's",125.46,125.68],["a",125.68,125.78],["key",125.78,126.04],["point",126.04,126.4],["we",126.4,126.6],["should",126.6,126.76],["make.",126.76,127.04],["Then",128.38,128.7],["the",128.7,128.9],["fold",128.9,129.18],["-up",129.18,129.36],["bike",129.36,129.64],["and",129.64,129.9],["others",129.9,130.26],["came",130.26,130.54],["along",130.54,130.78],["in",130.78,130.94],["the",130.94,131.02],["60s",131.02,131.64]]},{"start":131.64,"end":138.06,"text":"which helped sales pick up. Then things stayed fairly stable until the fitness craze of the","words":[["which",131.64,131.82],["helped",131.82,132.18],["sales",132.18,132.5],["pick",132.5,132.82],["up.",132.82,133.16],["Then",133.82,134.42],["things",134.42,134.88],["stayed",134.88,135.34],["fairly",135.34,135.86],["stable",135.86,136.38],["until",136.38,136.72],["the",136.72,136.96],["fitness",136.96,137.32],["craze",137.32,137.84],["of",137.84,137.94],["the",137.94,138.06]]},{"start":138.06,"end":143.62,"text":"80s peaked interest in mountain biking and sales went up, but the bike had lost its","words":[["80s",138.06,138.68],["peaked",138.68,139.02],["interest",139.02,139.46],["in",139.46,139.7],["mountain",139.7,140.06],["biking",140.06,140.54],["and",140.54,140.84],["sales",140.84,141.18],["went",141.18,141.46],["up,",141.46,141.88],["but",141.98,142.44],["the",142.44,142.58],["bike",142.58,142.86],["had",142.86,143.08],["lost",143.08,143.4],["its",143.4,143.62]]},{"start":143.62,"end":149.44,"text":"position as a key mode of transport. Right. I'd like to talk about some current projects","words":[["position",143.62,144.02],["as",144.02,144.22],["a",144.22,144.34],["key",144.34,144.6],["mode",144.6,144.88],["of",144.88,145.0],["transport.",145.0,145.4],["Right.",145.88,146.18],["I'd",147.18,147.64],["like",147.64,147.76],["to",147.76,147.92],["talk",147.92,148.08],["about",148.08,148.3],["some",148.3,148.52],["current",148.52,148.92],["projects",148.92,149.44]]},{"start":149.44,"end":154.68,"text":"around the world involving bikes. How about the scheme in an American school that provides","words":[["around",149.44,149.74],["the",149.74,149.92],["world",149.92,150.18],["involving",150.18,150.72],["bikes.",150.72,151.14],["How",151.74,151.94],["about",151.94,152.16],["the",152.16,152.3],["scheme",152.3,152.68],["in",152.68,152.88],["an",152.88,153.04],["American",153.04,153.4],["school",153.4,153.98],["that",153.98,154.26],["provides",154.26,154.68]]},{"start":154.68,"end":160.08,"text":"bikes for all its pupils? I expect the pupils are delighted, not to mention the parents.","words":[["bikes",154.68,155.18],["for",155.18,155.48],["all",155.48,155.74],["its",155.74,155.86],["pupils?",155.86,156.22],["I",157.08,157.3],["expect",157.3,157.54],["the",157.54,157.74],["pupils",157.74,157.98],["are",157.98,158.18],["delighted,",158.18,158.66],["not",159.08,159.18],["to",159.18,159.36],["mention",159.36,159.54],["the",159.54,159.72],["parents.",159.72,160.08]]},{"start":160.48,"end":165.84,"text":"I suppose so, although I wonder how much it costs. Probably not as much as other","words":[["I",160.48,160.62],["suppose",160.62,160.88],["so,",160.88,161.38],["although",161.96,162.2],["I",162.2,162.38],["wonder",162.38,162.62],["how",162.62,162.86],["much",162.86,163.08],["it",163.08,163.22],["costs.",163.22,163.68],["Probably",164.26,164.64],["not",164.64,164.9],["as",164.9,165.12],["much",165.12,165.36],["as",165.36,165.56],["other",165.56,165.84]]},{"start":165.84,"end":171.4,"text":"initiatives. I just wonder if the advantages really justify the scheme. While it must","words":[["initiatives.",165.84,166.36],["I",167.14,167.38],["just",167.38,167.54],["wonder",167.54,167.88],["if",167.88,168.22],["the",168.22,168.38],["advantages",168.38,168.86],["really",168.86,169.34],["justify",169.34,169.76],["the",169.76,170.02],["scheme.",170.02,170.42],["While",170.84,171.08],["it",171.08,171.22],["must",171.22,171.4]]},{"start":171.4,"end":177.84,"text":"enable pupils to get to school more easily. But does attendance actually improve? If there's","words":[["enable",171.4,171.74],["pupils",171.74,172.12],["to",172.12,172.42],["get",172.42,172.56],["to",172.56,172.74],["school",172.74,173.02],["more",173.02,173.28],["easily.",173.28,173.84],["But",174.44,174.64],["does",174.64,175.02],["attendance",175.02,175.48],["actually",175.48,176.28],["improve?",176.28,176.84],["If",177.5,177.66],["there's",177.66,177.84]]},{"start":177.84,"end":183.6,"text":"any data to support that, we need to include it, but I haven't found enough. Let's look into that later.","words":[["any",177.84,178.02],["data",178.02,178.34],["to",178.34,178.52],["support",178.52,178.88],["that,",178.88,179.18],["we",179.42,179.54],["need",179.54,179.72],["to",179.72,179.88],["include",179.88,180.22],["it,",180.22,180.52],["but",180.62,180.84],["I",180.84,181.28],["haven't",181.28,181.52],["found",181.52,181.74],["enough.",181.74,182.08],["Let's",182.34,182.68],["look",182.68,182.84],["into",182.84,183.02],["that",183.02,183.22],["later.",183.22,183.6]]},{"start":187.4,"end":193.26,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30.","words":[["Before",187.4,187.72],["you",187.72,188.0],["hear",188.0,188.22],["the",188.22,188.38],["rest",188.38,188.66],["of",188.66,188.8],["the",188.8,188.86],["discussion,",188.86,189.26],["you",189.84,190.04],["have",190.04,190.24],["some",190.24,190.42],["time",190.42,190.84],["to",190.84,191.08],["look",191.08,191.24],["at",191.24,191.38],["questions",191.38,191.74],["25",191.74,192.68],["to",192.68,192.92],["30.",192.92,193.26]]},{"start":223.75,"end":232.87,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30. Could we look at the results of the survey we","words":[["Now",223.75,224.07],["listen",224.07,224.37],["and",224.37,224.77],["answer",224.77,225.15],["questions",225.15,225.55],["25",225.55,226.53],["to",226.53,226.83],["30.",226.83,227.21],["Could",230.51,230.95],["we",230.95,231.15],["look",231.15,231.39],["at",231.39,231.51],["the",231.51,231.61],["results",231.61,231.91],["of",231.91,232.15],["the",232.15,232.27],["survey",232.27,232.63],["we",232.63,232.87]]},{"start":232.87,"end":236.07,"text":"did with cyclists. We each spoke to different people.","words":[["did",232.87,233.01],["with",233.01,233.21],["cyclists.",233.21,233.95],["We",234.53,234.79],["each",234.79,235.03],["spoke",235.03,235.31],["to",235.31,235.53],["different",235.53,235.75],["people.",235.75,236.07]]},{"start":236.57,"end":243.25,"text":"Yes. One of my first interviewees was David. He works from home and spends a lot of time","words":[["Yes.",236.57,236.77],["One",237.63,237.85],["of",237.85,237.97],["my",237.97,238.15],["first",238.15,238.51],["interviewees",238.51,239.31],["was",239.31,239.61],["David.",239.61,240.13],["He",240.75,240.93],["works",240.93,241.19],["from",241.19,241.41],["home",241.41,241.77],["and",241.77,242.19],["spends",242.19,242.49],["a",242.49,242.69],["lot",242.69,242.89],["of",242.89,243.03],["time",243.03,243.25]]},{"start":243.25,"end":249.19,"text":"indoors, so at weekends he goes out with a cycling club. He said it's a way to connect","words":[["indoors,",243.25,243.67],["so",243.97,244.27],["at",244.27,244.57],["weekends",244.57,245.01],["he",245.01,245.63],["goes",245.63,245.81],["out",245.81,246.05],["with",246.05,246.19],["a",246.19,246.33],["cycling",246.33,246.59],["club.",246.59,246.97],["He",247.67,247.87],["said",247.87,248.09],["it's",248.09,248.33],["a",248.33,248.33],["way",248.33,248.49],["to",248.49,248.77],["connect",248.77,249.19]]},{"start":249.19,"end":253.55,"text":"with people apart from the other benefits. Okay. Who else?","words":[["with",249.19,249.51],["people",249.51,249.89],["apart",249.89,250.17],["from",250.17,250.45],["the",250.45,250.59],["other",250.59,250.69],